{title:Happenstance}
{key:}

I came upon a happenstance it was leaning on a tree
I wondered if that happenstance was happening to me?
I tried to ask it questions I made gestures in the air
But I got the strong impression That it just didn't care

I asked for a one way ticket to a better life on Mars
Flying on a rocket ship that is faster than my car
I asked for it politely I made gestures in the air
But I got the strong impression that it just didn't care

So I took a different tack I pretended to be sad
I told it all about the bad luck my sixty years have had
I whispered it discretely I made gestures in the air
But I got the strong impression That it just didn't care

So engage with any happenstance that happens upon you
They like to talk and talk and talk but you should talk some too
It will ask a lot of questions and make gestures in the air
Just make sure to let it know that you don't really care
